      title: "Founder",
      bio: "CareLink360 is changing the way the world ages by helping older adults remain connected, engaged, stimulated, and supported—even as health challenges or cognitive decline begin to make their world smaller.  As people age, the activities, relationships, and experiences that once filled their lives can gradually become harder to access. Technology that was meant to connect them can become frustrating or overwhelming. Families worry from a distance, and care teams often struggle to provide meaningful engagement alongside essential day-to-day care.  CareLink360 opens that world back up.  Through our purpose-built Digital Health Companion and intelligent care platform, we create a simple, secure window into the people, memories, interests, and experiences that matter most to each individual. Older adults can see and connect with their families, enjoy familiar music and videos, receive personalized reminders, participate in cognitive and wellness activities, and stay engaged with the things they love—all without navigating passwords, complicated applications, or traditional consumer technology.  At the same time, CareLink360 gives families and professional care teams greater visibility, connection, and peace of mind, allowing them to remain meaningfully involved even when they cannot physically be present.  But CareLink360 goes beyond connection and engagement. We are transforming how care itself is delivered.  Millions of hours of home care are provided every day, yet long care visits can become unstructured and difficult to measure. CareLink360 helps transform those hours into intentional, structured, person-centered care. We equip caregivers with personalized activities, reminders, wellness interventions, cognitive stimulation, family engagement, and other meaningful interactions that can be incorporated throughout a visit—while creating greater consistency and accountability around the care being delivered.  This creates value across the entire care ecosystem: a better quality of life for older adults, greater peace of mind for families, more purposeful work for caregivers, and a more differentiated, measurable model of care for care organizations.  CareLink360 is building the infrastructure for a future in which aging does not have to mean becoming disconnected from the people and experiences that give life meaning. When an older adult's world begins to shrink, our mission is to make it bigger again—simply, securely, and personally.",
